   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="letter">
                <div type="mainBody">
                    <p>Letter received will reply later <choice>
                            <sic>volent</sic>
                            <corr>violent</corr>
                        </choice> <seg xml:id="seg1" type="note-anchor">eye attack</seg>
                    </p>
                    <closer>
                        <signed>        	<name type="person" key="joyc82">Joyce</name>
                        </signed>
                    </closer>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div type="notes">
                <note xml:id="note1" target="#seg1" type="commentary">In early July, JJ suffered an attack of iritis, from which he spent five weeks recovering with the aid of repeated doses of cocaine to relieve the pain (<name type="work">JJ</name> 517). He wrote to Harriet Weaver about his recovery in his <rs type="letter" key="L_68784">letter of 7 August 1921</rs> (<name type="work">LI</name> 168).</note>
            </div>
